{
  "frame_ms": 180,
  "notes": {
    "beats": "Five frames closed on the ghost light, ten to open, then stand, tip the hat, a long bow, stand again. Four frames snap the curtains shut and the bulb is back.",
    "ghost light": "The bare bulb a theater leaves burning after the house goes dark. It shows only in the closed gap. While the curtains are open the performer stands on that spot, in a pool of light.",
    "performer": "One figure, three outlines: standing, hat tipped into the raised hand, and a bow four pixels shorter with a red rose at the end of the arm. Hidden while the curtains are shut so the face cannot peek through the gap.",
    "curtains": "Four wide pleats, magenta in the fold and a white edge toward the stage. The same sprite is mirrored for the right curtain. They open slowly and close in four frames.",
    "marquee": "A chase along the top. Every bulb comes on for the bow and the rise after it."
  },
